{"hungry","",{"*{v:He} glances at your hands, then the house, then away*","*{v:His} stomach growls and {v:he} pretends not to notice*","*{v:He} swallows hard, eyes drifting toward the windows*","*{v:He} licks cracked lips and stands a little straighter*","*{v:His} coat hangs loose on a frame it used to fit*"}},
{"hungry","tr=wary,hates",{"*{v:He} keeps both hands open and empty at {v:his} sides*","*{v:He} asks without begging, and it clearly costs {v:him}*"}},
{"hungry","tr=warm,friend",{"*{v:He} manages a crooked, hopeful smile*","*{v:His} eyes brighten at the sound of your voice*"}},
{"hurt","",{"*{v:He} holds {v:his} side and tries to hide the wince*","*{v:He} leans on the frame like it is holding {v:him} up*","*{v:His} face is gray, and {v:his} breath comes in short pulls*","*{v:He} takes the weight off one leg, jaw tight*","*{v:He} keeps one hand pressed under {v:his} ribs*"}},
{"hurt","tr=wary,hates",{"*{v:He} stays upright out of stubbornness, jaw clenched*"}},
{"scared","",{"*{v:He} keeps glancing back over {v:his} shoulder*","*{v:His} hands shake, and {v:he} cannot make them stop*","*{v:He} flinches at every sound from the street*","*{v:He} breathes like {v:he}'s been running for a long time*","*{v:His} eyes search the dark behind you*"}},
{"scared","tr=hates,wary",{"*{v:He} takes half a step back, ready to bolt*"}},
{"weary","",{"*{v:He} rubs {v:his} eyes with the heel of {v:his} hand*","*{v:He} sways a little, as if the porch is tilting*","*{v:His} pack straps bite into {v:his} shoulders*","*{v:He} shifts from foot to foot, arms wrapped against the chill*","*{v:He} stifles a yawn, then looks embarrassed about it*","*{v:His} boots are caked with mud and coming apart at the toes*"}},
{"nervous","",{"*{v:He} fidgets with a strap on {v:his} bag and waits*","*{v:He} shifts {v:his} weight, unsure what to do with {v:his} hands*","*{v:He} clears {v:his} throat and glances at the door handle*","*{v:His} eyes dart to the windows, then back to you*","*{v:He} offers a polite, uncertain nod*","*{v:He} wipes {v:his} palms on {v:his} jacket*"}},
{"suspicious","",{"*{v:He} studies your hands before {v:he} studies your face*","*{v:His} eyes keep flicking to the gap in the door*","*{v:He} stands a careful arm's length back, watching you move*","*{v:He} folds {v:his} arms and does not look away*","*{v:His} jaw works as {v:he} weighs every word*"}},
{"suspicious","out=searched",{"*{v:He} lifts {v:his} arms slowly and stares past your shoulder*","*{v:He} holds very still and watches where your hands go*"}},
{"hopeful","",{"*{v:He} leans in a little, trying to read your face*","*{v:His} shoulders loosen, just slightly*","*{v:He} gives a small, tired half-smile*","*{v:He} nods, afraid to believe it yet*","*{v:His} eyes soften while {v:he} waits for your answer*"}},
